    <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The Norwegian Directorate of Health (Helsedirektoratet and the Norwegian Health Network (Norsk helsenett SF) invite the market to participate in a dialogue on how artificial intelligence, quality-assured knowledge sources and digital health services that can be combined to provide citizens with safe and quality-assured health advice.

